		"en": [
			"• Zeta Gundam appears as the memorable 10th installment of the RG series, which was released to commemorate Gunpla's 30th anniversary. ■Realistic reproduction of Zeta Gundam's mechanism through RG's own actual machine research. ■Perfect transformation realized at 1/144 Scale. ■New advanced MS joint adopted. ■Realistic decal included. Molded products x 13, realistic decal x 1, assembly manual x 1"
